	(text "Decoupling per Altera's Agilex 3 schematic review worksheet (v1.1, PWR_CAP) and the AXC3000: 1 uF / 4.7 uF 0201 on supply/GND ball pairs under the BGA (via-in-pad; counts are what the ball map holds), bulk 0603 in the via-free channels. VCCPLLDIG_SDM, VCCPLL_SDM, VCCADC and VCCRCORE each get a bead + 47 uF + 1 uF filter."
